{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-06-23 09:00:00', 'title': "TENTATIVE AGREEMENT REACHED FOR SOUTHWEST AIRLINES' MECHANICS & RELATED EMPLOYEES", 'text': 'DALLAS , JUNE 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. \xa0(NYSE: LUV) AND THE AIRCRAFT MECHANICS FRATERNAL ASSOCIATION (AMFA)\xa0HAVE REACHED A TENTATIVE AGREEMENT (TA) FOR THE AIRLINE\'S MECHANICS & RELATED EMPLOYEES. "OUR MECHANICS & RELATED EMPLOYEES WORK AROUND THE CLOCK TO SAFELY MAINTAIN OUR AIRCRAFT, AND WE REACHED A TENTATIVE AGREEMENT THAT REWARDS THEM AND HELPS SOUTHWEST MAINTAIN AN EFFICIENT OPERATION," SAID ADAM CARLISLE , VICE PRESIDENT LABOR RELATIONS AT SOUTHWEST AIRLINES®.'}